<title>USA: Sirco authorizes two-for-one stock split.</title>
<headline>Sirco authorizes two-for-one stock split.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sirco International Corp said Monday that it board of directors has has authorized a two-for-one split of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company said shareholders of record May 5 will be entitled to receive one new share of common stock for each share held.</p>
<p>Sirco designs, imports and markets luggage, sport bags, backpacks, children's bags and related products.</p>
